What is used:
  - Which permissions each call needs, from the pages of the calls and their include files: graph/permissions/operations/ (all.json, operations.json, and the copies in raw/).
  - The throttling limits and the cost of calls: graph/cost/ (cost.json, and the copies in raw/).
  - Which properties support which query options: graph/query/ (matrix.json, and the copies in raw/).
  - The client IDs of Microsoft's tools (graph/repo/seed.go), and the entry for the permission User.ReadUpdate.All in the permissions reference
    (graph/permissions/supplement.json).

